<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank sets $163 mln RPs.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank sets $163 mln RPs.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agentina's Central Bank said Thursday it had set overnight repurchase agreements for $163 million at nine percent.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, call money fell to 8.2 percent from 8.9 percent at the close Wednesday. The U.S. dollar eased to 0.9998 pesos from 0.99985 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom 541 318-0655</p>
</text>
